    "chunk_text": "Men \u00f0a leofestan, mana\u00f0 us & myndga\u00f0 on \u00feyssum bocum sanctus Gregorius, se halega writere se \u00f0is L\u00e6re\u00f0 he us \u00fe\u00e6t we sien gemyndige \u00feara worda \u00fee dryhten s\u00e6de on his bocum, \u00f0\u00e6t \u00feis woruldlice lif & he us eac s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t swylc yfel on \u00feysne middangeard becuman sceolde, \u00e6r he geendod w\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t he Men \u00f0a leofestan, ne l\u00e6ten we us n\u00e6fre \u00fea synne to \u00feon swi\u00f0e micele ne to \u00fean swi\u00f0e hefiglice \u00feyncan He \u00f0onne, se \u00e6\u00f0ela lareow, sanctus Paulus se apostol, spr\u00e6c & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Men \u00fea leofestan, us & \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6r n\u00e6nig man his sylfes gewyrhta behydan ne m\u00e6g, ne nan man his agenne andwlitan on Be \u00f0am se \u00e6lmihtega God s\u00e6de & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Filius hominis uenturus est in gloria cum angelis suis; Uton we nu georne \u00feencean, men \u00fea leofestan, hu arf\u00e6st & hu mildheort he eft cyme\u00f0 on \u00feam dome to Uton we nu ge\u00feencan hwylce we nu syn & hu us \u00feonne lyste\u00f0. Hw\u00e6t, we si\u00f0\u00f0an ne magon nane lade gedon, ac we sculon gehwylcra \u00feinga Gode riht ongyldan on & we us urne dryhten ondr\u00e6dan \u00fe\u00e6nne we hyne mid his m\u00e6gen\u00ferymme cumendne gesio\u00f0, in \u00f0am & hie \u00feonne, \u00fea englas, him beforan singan onginna\u00fe & cwe\u00f0a\u00f0: Arisa\u00fe nu ealle \u00fea forsciridan & & hie \u00feonne cuma\u00f0, \u00fea englas, to \u00fe",
